; Two cards a segment in (kind, dur in ms), the segment's frames out (25 ms each). The time so far is kept as
; whole frames not yet handed out (D) and ms over (rem); a segment gets the frames that bring the handed-out total
; to the time so far rounded (rem from 13 up rounds up), but at least one for a sound and two for a stop or an
; affricate (kinds 4 and 6), none for a pause. A stop's duration is its closure, and its burst gets one frame more
; after it: the stop's frames go out one more, and the time so far moves on by that frame too, so D is left as
; it would be without it.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   kind     03-15: the time so far, in whole frames and ms over
  04                    INP   dur
  05                    CLA   rem
  06                    ADD   dur
  07                    STO   rem
  08            whole   CLA   rem
  09                    SUB   c25
  10                    TAC   round
  11                    STO   rem
  12                    CLA   dd
  13                    ADD   00
  14                    STO   dd
  15                    JMP   whole
  16            round   CLA   rem      16-23: n = D, one more if rem rounds up
  17                    SUB   c13
  18                    TAC   nr
  19                    CLA   dd
  20                    ADD   00
  21                    JMP   setn
  22            nr      CLA   dd
  23            setn    STO   n
  24                    CLA   z        24-49: the least: none for a pause, two for a stop or affricate, else one
  25                    STO   least
  26                    CLA   kind
  27                    SUB   c8
  28                    TAC   snd
  29                    JMP   min
  30            snd     CLA   00
  31                    STO   least
  32                    CLA   kind
  33                    SUB   n4
  34                    TAC   min
  35                    SUB   00
  36                    TAC   two
  37                    SUB   00
  38                    TAC   min
  39                    SUB   00
  40                    TAC   two
  41                    JMP   min
  42            two     CLA   n2
  43                    STO   least
  44            min     CLA   n
  45                    SUB   least
  46                    TAC   up
  47                    JMP   out
  48            up      CLA   least
  49                    STO   n
  50            out     CLA   dd       50-75: D less n; n out, one more for a stop's burst
  51                    SUB   n
  52                    STO   dd
  53                    CLA   kind
  54                    SUB   n4
  55                    TAC   emit
  56                    SUB   00
  57                    TAC   stop
  58            emit    OUT   n
  59                    JMP   rec
  60            stop    CLA   n
  61                    ADD   00
  62                    STO   n
  63                    JMP   emit
  64            kind    DATA  0
  65            dur     DATA  0
  66            rem     DATA  0
  67            dd      DATA  0
  68            n       DATA  0
  69            least   DATA  0
  70            z       DATA  0
  71            c25     DATA  25
  72            c13     DATA  13
  73            c8      DATA  8
  74            n4      DATA  4
  75            n2      DATA  2
